-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record since 1951 shows January to February and April to May each came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. On that same middle, May to June ran 41% of normal in 2025 and June to July ran 40% in 2025. So far in 2026, February to March sits at 46% and June to July at 49% on the middle. Grid 24983 had its driest year in 2012 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
